        "text": "Blockchain technology is the critical technology enabling such decentralization across numerous fields. Defi smart contracts, Dapps and DAOs are the use cases and tools that propel the evolution toward decentralization. Of course, decentralization won't be a cure all solution. No single technology can ever be. But adoption of decentralization can serve to counter some of the weaknesses of the traditional paradigm of hierarchy and central authorities. Congratulations on completing this course on decentralization. Remember to check out Binance Academy's website and follow us on YouTube, Facebook, and Twitter to stay tuned for future courses. See you in Binance Academy's next course.",
